  "whyTopTier": "A 37-shot montage that earns its product shots with a history of the Start button, then films typing in the search field at a size where one word fills the frame. 36.6 s.",
  "instrument": "No camera moves at all (still 88%); 17 of 36 cuts are dissolves, several over 1 s, which are the montage's crossfades.",
  "byEye": {
    "zoom": "full screens for the history; real UI at ×2–4 (the search field fills the width; the sidebar fills half)",
