  "critique": {
    "like": "The history-of-Start cold open makes 'Finally' land as a punchline rather than a feature name.",
    "wish": "Thirteen seconds of UI at 0.9 s a shot never lets one flow finish; it sells the platform, not a task.",
    "wonder": "A counter card fed by a real number (scenes recorded, users seeded) could be a cutscene card type."
  },
